	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Salutarunt me hi duo adolescentes rogantes, si quid vellem scribere; promisi, scribo, sed quid?</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Tempus erat breve; breviter igitur audi, quę te scire volo.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Prutenus princeps obiit mortem; desi<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>net itaque forsan <persName ref="p2301">Osiander</persName> a sua insania, nisi fuerit nactus alium principem ęque, ut ille fuit, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>seductum, quamvis hactenus non omnino egerit imprudenter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>De <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensibus</placeName> satis te instruent.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">De illo fortassis non admodum curarunt, quod <persName ref="p8441">Schwencfeldiani</persName> plus, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quam decet, multiplicantur <placeName ref="l491">Argentinę</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Accedunt nobiles, ut, si tu quoque velis nobilitate ornari, queas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>id adsequi, si fias <persName ref="p8441">Schwencfeldianus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Anabaptistę similiter capita tollunt nonnisi in odium veri <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ministerii.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Illi vero videntur mihi <persName ref="p4714">Epicuręi</persName>, adeo superbiunt; nihil a novo monachatu di<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>fferunt, ita iactant de probitate se; non habent, qui illis resistant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">D. d. <persName ref="p8374">Hedio</persName> laborat urtigine, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Battus calculo, <persName ref="p1910">Lenglius</persName> febri quartano, d. <persName ref="p18137">Marbachius</persName> abest adhuc cum <persName>Christophoro</persName> <placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName>; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>pauci sunt reliqui, qui iustam operam adhibeant.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Senatus propter tumultus bellicos vix est apud se.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Hactenus de <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensibus</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>De bello <placeName ref="l2481">Svevico</placeName> tu nosse potes omnia melius quam ego; rumores tantum huc veniunt.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ab <placeName ref="l20">Inferioribus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Germanis</placeName> certiora narrantur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18250">Mauritius</persName> dicitur in itinere esse ad <placeName ref="l2481">Svevos</placeName>, civitatem <placeName ref="l322">Metensem</placeName> etiam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>a <placeName ref="l327">Monte Belligardo</placeName> occupatam nunciant.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8112">Gallus</persName> per <placeName ref="l2345">Keysersluteren</placeName> <placeName ref="l471">Spiram</placeName> versus proficiscitur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p714">Cęlius</persName> dicit <placeName ref="l3105">Mirandulam</placeName> constantem esse, carere tamen vino et lignis; edunt stratagemata, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>qualia <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> ederunt.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Nuperrime satis cum astu destruxerunt vallum, quos hostis extru<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>xerat prope civitatis moenia, et hostem fugarunt.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Crastinus dies erit septimus, dum Itali nobiles <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>hęc retulerunt recta venientes ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Rumor huc venerat concilium esse sublatum; scripsit tamen <persName ref="p18137">Marbachius</persName> uxori suę 16. martii se cum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>suis venisse <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentum</placeName> putantes proximo die futuram sessionem, cęterum eam suspensam esse ad 1. diem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>maii.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><persName>Philippus</persName> vocatus a prinicpe suo per <placeName ref="l361">Norembergam</placeName> proficiscitur in <placeName ref="l749">Saxoniam</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Mirabilis rumor volat episcopum <placeName ref="l2165">Atrebatensem</placeName> nonnihil declinasse ad <persName ref="p8112">Gallum</persName>, a Cęsare arreptum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et decollatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Occidendo occidet aliquando se ipsum.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis in Christo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName ref="p8459">Othonem</persName> salutari iuberem, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nisi nunc ageret felicius; flebile nuncium nunciaras.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 18. aprilis anno 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8418">Os[valdus] Myconius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName>, in Christo reverendo suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
